{"id":"fg2xnmf0s61ypkx3pwflei61p","title":"为什么science叫科学？","originalTitle":"为什么science叫“科学”？","summary":"science一词源于拉丁文“知识”，科学是一种系统性的知识体系。明治维新时期，日本人借用“科”的本意，将science翻译为科学，即分科之学。西周在《知说（四）》中提出，科学是将事实归纳成一贯之真理，并表达成一模范，其核心在于格物致知。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=217198&do=blog&id=1560106"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T03:57:19.971Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T03:57:19.971Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":13,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}